    "body": "Hi @pszlazak 👋\r\nThank you for the heads up!\r\n\r\n\r\nI've gone ahead and tried reproducing your report using VirusTotal, but it seems they don't have Semantec has part of the suite. Nevertheless, The only release raising flags seems to be the i686 release, with Acronis.\r\n\r\n**VirusTotal runs on v1.4.2**\r\n- [starship-aarch64-pc-windows-msvc](https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/0633fa18eee04570c3753e33cee9698cc4674267f60f603a0c111536b6606bac)\r\n- [starship-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc](https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/04c6fddb4342fb11e5fb38e0cb68747aa97d56e08f2e79685076b1687da971a2)\r\n- [starship-i686-pc-windows-msvc](https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/1a1a570fcc701bf65dc771b1d26fb01fc913ecc0ac2ce37d2a13a0a7c2782eb6)\r\n\r\nWould you be willing to quickly submit a false-positive report with Semantec? It looks like it shouldn't take longer than 2-3 mins.\r\nhttps://symsubmit.symantec.com/\r\n",
